<p>Checking out of a big beachfront hotel in Costa Adeje on departure day involves more moving parts than checking out of a small guesthouse elsewhere on the island. Many of the resort's larger properties operate a set checkout time around midday, yet flights rarely align neatly with that schedule, leaving a gap of several hours between handing back your room key and actually needing to be at the airport. A private transfer timed to your flight rather than your checkout means you are never forced to choose between an awkward early departure from your room and an equally awkward wait in a lobby with luggage.</p>
